# Motion (iOS)

Attach Motion only after the device session starts. Register state, error, and sample observers before `motion.start()`. Treat every sensor component as optional, stop and cancel observers before `session.removeMotion()`, and use MockDevice motion recordings for deterministic tests. Motion has no runtime permission and is experimental.

